  (text "RF lines (GNSS_RF_IN, ANT_INT, ANT_EXT_SW, GNSS_EXT_RF): 50 ohm grounded coplanar waveguide on F.Cu over the In1 plane, 0.34 mm wide, 0.45 mm gaps, GND via fence."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "2ee128cb-5b73-5366-cab9-46c983636332"))
  (text "Antenna select (firmware): at boot ANT_SEL is high (built-in patch) and the bias is off. The MCU turns Q50 on and reads ANT_SENSE: 3-60 mA = external active antenna, ANT_SEL low (SMA); under 3 mA = none (or passive), stay on the patch; above 80 mA = short, bias off, retry every 5 s."
    (at 20 262 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "c80a33cb-78b8-a1a2-2427-0a8910e1d733"))
  (text "External antenna: active, 2.7-5 V, up to 30 mA (about 3.0 V at the jack at 15 mA). A passive antenna works too if chosen in setup."
    (at 20 267 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "ef2e7c92-b3c8-cb35-ef41-5f4a2d74271b"))
  (text "VCC_RF (pin 9) unused: the bias comes from Q50 so the firmware can switch and measure it."
    (at 20 272 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "8a2ae599-728b-b0ab-577d-93d60c28f85c"))
  (text "VDD_USB (pin 7) to GND: USB unused (u-blox: connect V_USB to ground when USB is not used). D_SEL open = UART1 + I2C."
    (at 20 277 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "df982432-5c15-cb56-b471-27fe396eb523"))
  (text "Standard NEO footprint: the NEO-F9P (L1/L5 RTK) drops in with the same pins and wiring (the patch is L1 only; use the SMA for L5)."
    (at 20 282 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "10fb2c49-9d04-0768-edb0-20f578c09c17")))
